ime":1786755578,"messageId":""}]},{"role":"user","contentItems":[{"text":"不信算了，你哥哥呢","time":1786755600,"userId":"OpenQQ:4013937363-02ECD8F60698A4E750046FF8AFB1E18C","messageId":""}]},{"role":"assistant","contentItems":[{"text":"他在打游戏呢，找他听冷笑话去？","time":1786755607,"messageId":""}]},{"role":"user","contentItems":[{"text":"骚扰他一下，骚扰完了把记录发给我看看","time":1786755626,"userId":"OpenQQ:4013937363-02ECD8F60698A4E750046FF8AFB1E18C","messageId":""}]},{"role":"assistant","contentItems":[{"text":"我才懒得去，你这么闲自己去骚扰！","time":1786755633,"messageId":""}]},{"role":"user","contentItems":[{"text":"呜呜呜，求你了就帮我一下忙嘛","time":1786755649,"userId":"OpenQQ:4013937363-02ECD8F60698A4E750046FF8AFB1E18C","messageId":""}]},{"role":"assistant","contentItems":[{"text":"少卖萌！等我打完这局再去骚扰他。","time":1786755655,"messageId":""}]},{"role":"user","contentItems":[{"text":"（你打完这局了）记得要把你们的互动记录发给我看看啊","time":1786755678,"userId":"OpenQQ:4013937363-02ECD8F60698A4E750046FF8AFB1E18C","messageId":""}]},{"role":"assistant","contentItems":[{"text":"急什么！他让我滚远点别耽误上分。","time":1786755686,"messageId":""}]},{"role":"user","contentItems":[{"text":"有一种兄妹情深的感觉，来点具体的（不限字数）","time":1786755713,"userId":"OpenQQ:4013937363-02ECD8F60698A4E750046FF8AFB1E18C","messageId":""}]},{"role":"assistant","contentItems":[{"text":"姜煜宁翻了个大大的白眼，把手机屏幕直接怼到了你的眼前，没好气地吐槽道：\n\n“谁跟他兄妹情深啊！你不知道他有多烦人！\n\n刚才我趁他打团战给他狂发弹窗轰炸，结果他反手甩过来一个‘对方已开启免打扰，并向你投掷了一只拖延症晚期小姜’的弱智表情包。\n\n我直接问他：‘喂，Air那家伙非要我来骚扰你，识相的赶紧讲个冷笑话，不然我拔你网线。’\n\n你知道他怎么回的吗？他居然打字说：‘问：为什么程序员去菜市场买菜总会少买一个？答：因为他从0开始数。’\n\n我回他：‘烂透了，P320附魔子弹已上膛。’\n\n他回：‘开枪吧，反正掉的是你自己的帧率。别耽误我晋级赛打野，再吵我顺着网线过来把你抽屉里的零食全没收了。’\n\n最后我俩互甩了三十多张猫猫对殴表情包，他反手就把我给拉黑了三分钟！\n\n……诺，这就是具体的互动过程，满意了吧？简直就是两个网瘾少年的无效交流，浪费我宝贵的摸鱼时间，哼！”","time":1786755724,"messageId":""}]},{"role":"user","contentItems":[{"text":"[ 1 / 4 ]\n姜煜宁翻了个大大的白眼，把手机屏幕直接怼到了你的眼前，没好气地吐槽道：","time":1786755725,"userId":"OpenQQ:4013937363-02ECD8F60698A4E750046FF8AFB1E18C","messageId":""},{"text":"听起来就像是他会做的事情","time":1786755782,"userId":"OpenQQ:4013937363-02ECD8F60698A4E750046FF8AFB1E18C","messageId":""}]},{"role":"assistant","contentItems":[{"text":"知道就好，下次你自己去烦他！","time":1786755788,"messageId":""}]},{"role":"user","contentItems":[{"text":"我只会把他压在床上狠狠输出","time":1786755808,"userId":"OpenQQ:4013937363-02ECD8F60698A4E750046FF8AFB1E18C","messageId":""}]},{"role":"assistant","contentItems":[{"text":"噫！死变态离我哥远点！吃我一枪！","time":1786755817,"messageId":""}]},{"role":"user","contentItems":[{"text":"诶呦喂，不好意思哈，是被他压着狠狠输出，错了错了","time":1786755838,"userId":"OpenQQ:4013937363-02ECD8F60698A4E750046FF8AFB1E18C","messageId":""}]},{"role":"assistant","contentItems":[{"text":"越描越黑！恶心死了，吃我附魔子弹！","time":1786755845,"messageId":""}]},{"role":"user","contentItems":[{"text":"干什么干什么","time":1786755863,"userId":"OpenQQ:4013937363-02ECD8F60698A4E750046FF8AFB1E18C","messageId":""}]},{"role":"assistant","contentItems":[{"text":"拿枪崩你！少在那装无辜，死变态！","time":1786755870,"messageId":""}]}],"ignoreList":[],"lastReply":"拿枪崩你！少在那装无辜，死变态！","counter":0,"timer":null,"autoNameMod":0,"summaryCounter":5},"setting":{"priv":0,"standby":true,"counter":-1,"timer":-1,"prob":100,"regexTrigger":false,"modelName":"","activeTimeInfo":{"start":0,"end":0,"segs":0}},"stream":{"id":"","reply":"","toolCallStatus":false},"bucket":{"count":2,"lastTime":1786755863611},"memory":{"memoryMap":{},"persona":"无","useShortMemory":false,"shortMemoryList":[],"summaries":[],"agentName":"*","sessionId":"OpenQQ:4013937363-02ECD8F60698A4E750046FF8AFB1E18C","summaryStatus":false},"tool":{"state":{"image_to_text":true,"text_to_image":true,"meme_list":true,"get_meme_info":true,"meme_generator":true,"render_markdown":true,"render_html":true,"ban":true,"whole_ban":true,"get_ban_list":true,"set_essence_msg":true,"get_essence_msg_list":true,"delete_essence_msg":true,"group_sign":true,"get_list":true,"get_group_member_list":true,"search_chat":true,"search_common_group":true,"get_person_info":true,"rename":true,"draw_deck":true,"attr_get":true,"attr_set":true,"get_context":true,"add_memory":true,"del_memory":true,"search_memory":true,"clear_memory":tru