2","messageId":""},{"text":"<@54B86BF3D08F75524FCD293C9F6E207F> 才是真正的狼王，他从不对谁摇尾乞怜，哪怕风雨压境，脊梁也挺得笔直。对无关紧要的人和事，向来懒得多费口舌，眼底的淡漠像冰封的荒原，生人勿近。认定的路便只顾往前踏，从不在意旁人的议论或劝阻，那份独断的决绝，带着不容置喙的威严。偶尔流露的柔软，只给最亲近的人，其余时候，他永远是自带锋芒的王者，不屑于迎合，更不会妥协","time":1786770149,"userId":"OpenQQ:4013937363-F2D124941C13E1E18F01E4DD16C60D32","messageId":""}]},{"role":"assistant","contentItems":[{"text":"谁是狼王啊？大白天发癫尬死谁呢。","time":1786770169,"messageId":""}]},{"role":"user","contentItems":[{"text":"<faceType=6,faceId=\"0\",ext=\"eyJ0ZXh0IjoiIn0=\">[img:kvxxtx]","time":1786770173,"userId":"OpenQQ:4013937363-F2D124941C13E1E18F01E4DD16C60D32","messageId":""},{"text":" <@54B86BF3D08F75524FCD293C9F6E207F> 看看你的枪","time":1786770186,"userId":"OpenQQ:4013937363-0FA342D87FC0FC41807B0CE977FCDF7C","messageId":""},{"text":"为什么他一直在骂我","time":1786770189,"userId":"OpenQQ:4013937363-F2D124941C13E1E18F01E4DD16C60D32","messageId":""},{"text":"[img:d8hdd3]","time":1786770190,"userId":"OpenQQ:4013937363-0FA342D87FC0FC41807B0CE977FCDF7C","messageId":""}]},{"role":"assistant","contentItems":[{"text":"附魔P320，想看就直接吃我一枪！","time":1786770191,"messageId":""}]},{"role":"user","contentItems":[{"text":"怎么是这个枪","time":1786770206,"userId":"OpenQQ:4013937363-0FA342D87FC0FC41807B0CE977FCDF7C","messageId":""},{"text":" <@54B86BF3D08F75524FCD293C9F6E207F> 戴上单片眼镜","time":1786770211,"userId":"OpenQQ:4013937363-F2D124941C13E1E18F01E4DD16C60D32","messageId":""}]},{"role":"assistant","contentItems":[{"text":"戴什么眼镜？危险分子吃我一枪！","time":1786770216,"messageId":""}]},{"role":"user","contentItems":[{"text":"连这个都有","time":1786770227,"userId":"OpenQQ:4013937363-F2D124941C13E1E18F01E4DD16C60D32","messageId":""},{"text":"我以为姜姜是耍长枪的，怎么是冲锋枪","time":1786770229,"userId":"OpenQQ:4013937363-0FA342D87FC0FC41807B0CE977FCDF7C","messageId":""}]},{"role":"assistant","contentItems":[{"text":"P320是手枪，笨猫眼神不好吧？","time":1786770233,"messageId":""}]},{"role":"user","contentItems":[{"text":"还真是","time":1786770241,"userId":"OpenQQ:4013937363-02ECD8F60698A4E750046FF8AFB1E18C","messageI